  << /ActualText (Profile\n \nSoftware engineer with a background in education and classical languages\056 I currently work on a server\055side team at Shazam\054 where I build and improve services and data pipelines that power music discovery for hundreds of millions of users\056\n\nI love to learn\054 prototype\054 and write code that\031s easy for the next engineer to work on\056 Projects recognised by Ofsted and Innovate UK\056\n\nEducation\n  \nLevel 4 Apprenticeship \050Distinction\051\054\nSoftware Engineering\nApple\054 Makers\n09\05724 \055 01\05726\nMA European History \050Distinction\051\nHumboldt\055Universit\344t zu Berlin\054\nKing\031s College London\n09\05713 \055 06\05715\nBA Latin\054 University of Oregon\054 USA\n09\05704 \055 06\05709\n\nLanguages\n  English \174 German \174 Spanish \174 French \n       Italian \174 Latin \174 Classical Greek\n)
