  << /ActualText (Technical Skills\n  \nLanguages\072 Kotlin\054 Java\054 Scala\054 SQL\nGCP \046 Data\072 Cloud Run \050Serverless APIs\051\054 Dataproc \050Apache Spark\051\054 Cloud Composer \050Airflow\051\nInfra\072 Terraform \050IaC\051\054 Helm\054 Docker\054 CI\057CD pipelines\nEngineering\072 Distributed systems\054 TDD\n\nProfessional Experience\n  \nApprentice Software Engineer\nApple\054 London\n09\05724 \055 present\n\nTest\055drove development of a new music video discovery feature on the Shazam Android team\054 writing in Kotlin and working closely with product\054 design and analytics\056\nDesigned and delivered a new internal web platform\054 providing secure\054 authenticated access to protected data across multiple GCP and AWS\055hosted backend services\056\nBuilt and debugged cloud\055based microservices that interface with distributed data pipelines to handle high\055volume data ingestion\056\n\nTeaching Assistant\054\nLe Wagon Web Development Bootcamp\n01\05724 \055 09\05724\nTeacher of Classics and History\nSt Philip\031s School\054 Scuola Italiana a Londra and private tutoring\n09\05717 \055 09\05723\n \nHobby Projects\n \nCheddar \0502023\05524\051\n\nEngineered data pipelines and API integrations to power a graduate jobs platform developed with funding from Innovate UK\056\nSchool Compare \0502024\051\n \nCollaborated on a Spring Boot web application\054 leading integration with MapBox API to build an interactive JavaScript map feature\056\nQuizzy \0502021\05522\051\n \nCreated a very customisable quiz platform for classroom learning\054 used in schools and recognised by Ofsted for educational impact\056\n )
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 1352 0 R
     /Pg 1344 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
